# Replace HWID License with Supabase Email/Password Login

## Background

FastSora v1.2.8 uses a HWID-based license system that:
1. Calls `auth_client.exe` to get encrypted HWID + payload
2. Sends POST to `http://103.163.24.92:3000/api/v2/check`
3. Verifies server response signature via `auth_client.exe --verify`

**Goal:** Replace this with Supabase email/password authentication.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Please provide your Supabase credentials:
> - **Supabase URL**: `https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co`
> - **Supabase Anon Key**: `eyJh...` (public anon key)
> - **User Table Name**: (if custom, default is `profiles`)

---

## Proposed Changes

### Main Process ([out/main/_index.js](file:///D:/sorabatchcreatevideo-1.1.0-setup/fastsora-1.2.8-setup/$PLUGINSDIR/app-64-extracted/resources/app-unpacked/out/main/_index.js))

#### [MODIFY] [_index.js](file:///D:/sorabatchcreatevideo-1.1.0-setup/fastsora-1.2.8-setup/$PLUGINSDIR/app-64-extracted/resources/app-unpacked/out/main/_index.js)

**1. Add Supabase Client Import (line ~30)**
```diff
+const { createClient } = require("@supabase/supabase-js");
+const SUPABASE_URL = "https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co";
+const SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = "eyJh..."; // User to provide
+const supabase = createClient(SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY);
```

**2. Replace [setupLicenseHandlers()](file:///D:/sorabatchcreatevideo-1.1.0-setup/fastsora-1.2.8-setup/$PLUGINSDIR/app-64-extracted/resources/app-unpacked/out/main/_index.js#4429-4469) function (lines 4429-4467)**
```javascript
const setupLicenseHandlers = () => {
  electron.ipcMain.handle("app:getVersion", () => pkg.version);
  
  // NEW: Supabase Login
  electron.ipcMain.handle("license:login", async (event, email, password) => {
    try {
      const { data, error } = await supabase.auth.signInWithPassword({
        email,
        password
      });
      if (error) {
        return { valid: false, message: error.message };
      }
      // Optional: Check user profile/license in database
      const { data: profile } = await supabase
        .from('profiles')
        .select('*')
        .eq('id', data.user.id)
        .single();
      
      return {
        valid: true,
        user: data.user,
        profile: profile
      };
    } catch (error) {
      return { valid: false, message: error.message };
    }
  });
  
  // NEW: Check current session
  electron.ipcMain.handle("license:checkSession", async () => {
    const { data: { session } } = await supabase.auth.getSession();
    if (session) {
      return { valid: true, user: session.user };
    }
    return { valid: false };
  });
  
  // NEW: Logout
  electron.ipcMain.handle("license:logout", async () => {
    await supabase.auth.signOut();
    return { success: true };
  });
};
```

